#Short-Term Engineering Education Project

##Role: Project Support Assistant

##Overview
This repository presents materials related to a short-term engineering education initiative aimed at providing practical training in modern manufacturing technologies, including 3D modeling, additive manufacturing, CNC machining, and laser engraving.
The project was implemented at a professional college with support from international partners and local industry.

##My Contribution
Although I was not an official member of the project management team, 
I participated as a project support assistant and contributed to several technical and organizational tasks, including:
- assisting in preparation of educational materials;
- supporting documentation development;
- preparing technical presentations;
- organizing project information;
- reviewing training materials;
- participating in pilot learning activities;
- assisting with presentation preparation.

##Project Topics
The educational program covered:
- 3D modeling
- CAD technologies
- CNC machining
- Laser engraving
- 3D printing
- Digital manufacturing fundamentals

##Technologies
- PowerPoint
- Microsoft Word
- CAD / 3D Printing concepts
- CNC technologies
- Laser engraving

##Project Status
Educational project completed.
